inear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-558/weekly-star-count-has-wrong-image \"\u200c\")\n- [Hard crash](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-475/consecutive-glass-impact-sfxvfx-causes-crash-on-android \"\u200c\") bug on Android after consecutive glass VFX/SFX\n- [Quitting level mid tornado boost breaks the object physics](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-554/quiting-level-mid-tornado-boost-breaks-the-object-physics \"\u200c\")\n- [Refill algorithm spawns fewer items over time for both events. ](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-546/bug-refill-algorithm-spawns-fewer-items-over-time \"\u200c\")\n- [Zombie track spawn is not consistent](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-438/investigate-why-some-zombie-tracks-do-not-spawn \"\u200c\") and causes level design imbalance.\n- [Fast matching targets an already dead zombies](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-535/fast-matching-might-target-an-already-dead-zombie \"\u200c\").\n  - it's still happens for samsung devices, that's why I couldn't repro.\n- Premature ending in levels containing [USERNAME_4464] [\\@\u200c[PERSON_NAME_0055]](https://harmonygamesgroup.Slack.com/team/U04TWDMDT0V \"\u200c\")\n  - lvl 12, lvl 33, and lvl 93\n- [On Android, if I home out during a level](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-559/homing-out-on-android-sound-disappears \"\u200c\"), and home back in, my sound completely disappears. And if I were to finish a level, I hard freeze at end game victory screen\n  - Doesn't happen to me, might be again a Samsung issue but I need to see video\n- [List of UI issues](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-498/fixing-ui-elements-on-home-screen \"\u200c\") listed for various parts of the game.\n  - The[ trampoline UI](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-536/trampoline-icon-is-not-consistent-and-model-should-be-updated \"\u200c\") is not consistent across icons and 3d model.\n  - Tornado icon is too low-res.\n- The first time loss after [win streak doesn't reset](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-520/first-loss-as-level-doesnt-reset-win-streak \"\u200c\") the win streak.\n- Poison effect in [kill cam causes perceived unresponsiveness](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-477/dot-kills-can-take-too-long-and-cause-perceived-unresponsivenes \"\u200c\") \u2013 UX feels frozen needs product decision.\n- Zombie Health [bar persists too long](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-481/zombie-health-bar-persists-too-long-after-death \"\u200c\") which causes visual clutter along with miscalculated object targets\n- [First loss as level doesn't reset win streak](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-520/first-loss-as-level-doesnt-reset-win-streak \"\u200c\") - happens only in lvl 21\n- [Infinite lives from new-install are not granted,](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-483/infinite-lives-from-new-install-are-not-granted-rewards-30-min-in-the \"\u200c\") rewards 30 min in the next session start.\n- [Quitting algo levels makes the level change animation](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-458/quitting-algo-levels-still-makes-the-level-change-animation \"\u200c\")\n- [The abandoned pack win streak freezer reward is not granted. ](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-560/the-abandoned-pack-win-streak-freezer-reward-is-not-granted \"\u200c\")\n- [On low-end devices, items surfaces vertical to camera is black.](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-561/on-low-end-devices-items-surfaces-vertical-to-camera-is-black \"\u200c\")", "pos": 140737488281600.0, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": true, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": [], "idShort": 58, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/cXpOQq99/58-minor-bugs-to-fix-vincent.parker", "dateLastActivity": "2025-10-10T22:45:18Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello